          <qtimetadata>
            <qtimetadatafield>
              <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
              <fieldentry>essay_question</fieldentry>
            </qtimetadatafield>
            <qtimetadatafield>
              <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
              <fieldentry>5</fieldentry>
            </qtimetadatafield>
          </qtimetadata>
        </itemmetadata>
        <presentation>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>Part B: Group Project Check-In - Team Plan (5 points)</strong></p>
<p><strong>GROUP LEADER SUBMITS</strong> a team plan including:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Team Roster:</strong> Names and contact info of all group members</li>
<li><strong>Communication Plan:</strong> How will you communicate? (email, text, Slack, etc.)</li>
<li><strong>Meeting Schedule:</strong> At least 2-3 meeting times for Weeks 8-10 (dates and times)</li>
<li><strong>Division of Responsibilities:</strong> Who handles data loading, AI consultations, analysis, slides, report writing?</li>
<li><strong>Preliminary Timeline:</strong> When will you complete data analysis, AI comparison, presentation draft, and report?</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Submit as:</strong> Text entry OR file upload (PDF/Word). Length: 1-2 pages.</p>
<p><strong>Grading:</strong> Completion-based (5 points for reasonable plan).</p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong> Only the group leader submits. All team members get the same grade.</p>]]></mattext>
          </material>
          <response_str ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
            <render_fib>
              <response_label ident="answer1"/>
            </render_fib>
          </response_str>
        </presentation>
        <resprocessing>
          <outcomes>
            <decvar maxvalue="5" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
          </outcomes>
        </resprocessing>
      </item>

    </section>
  </assessment>
